WEBVTT

1
00:00:06.274 --> 00:00:15.399
Zann watched the blob make its way toward the group.

2
00:00:15.419 --> 00:00:18.461
"Do you think this thing can swallow a person?"

3
00:00:18.821 --> 00:00:19.721
he muttered to Perda.

4
00:00:20.402 --> 00:00:20.982
Perda gulped.

5
00:00:21.002 --> 00:00:24.784
"I don't know, and I have no intention of finding out."

6
00:00:25.625 --> 00:00:28.787
The blob spread out and formed a circle around the group.

7
00:00:28.807 --> 00:00:34.270
Then it started moving inward, forcing the group into a smaller and smaller space.

8
00:00:34.290 --> 00:00:36.551
"Everyone, keep together!"

9
00:00:36.971 --> 00:00:37.492
ordered Vig.

10
00:00:38.552 --> 00:00:42.054
Zann looked for an escape, but he didn't see one—they were surrounded.

11
00:00:42.835 --> 00:00:45.036
Zing was by Zann's feet, chattering nervously.

12
00:00:45.857 --> 00:00:46.957
Zann had an idea.

13
00:00:46.977 --> 00:00:48.678
"Zing," Zann whispered.

14
00:00:48.698 --> 00:00:52.600
"Sing!" Zing leaped into the air and began whistling.

15
00:00:53.341 --> 00:00:56.483
Zann held his breath, hoping the song would distract the creature.

16
00:00:56.803 --> 00:00:58.264
But the blob kept closing in.

17
00:00:59.432 --> 00:01:02.893
"Maybe it doesn't work on creatures from other worlds," Darb said.

18
00:01:03.653 --> 00:01:06.574
Zing stopped his song and let out a whistle of frustration.

19
00:01:07.334 --> 00:01:10.435
Then he swooped down, shooting flames at the blob.

20
00:01:11.135 --> 00:01:14.076
To Zann's astonishment, the flames didn't burn the blob.

21
00:01:14.776 --> 00:01:18.857
Instead they were absorbed into the creature, making it grow even bigger.

22
00:01:19.598 --> 00:01:21.258
Then something strange happened.

23
00:01:22.298 --> 00:01:28.040
The blob started to move away from Zann and the others, eagerly catching every flame Zing shot at

24
00:01:28.820 --> 00:01:33.541
it. As it moved away, the circle it had formed was broken, and the blob no longer surrounded

25
00:01:33.581 --> 00:01:33.901
the group.

26
00:01:34.762 --> 00:01:37.322
Still shooting flames, Zing started flying away.

27
00:01:38.023 --> 00:01:44.224
The blob followed, absorbing all the fire it could, growing bigger each time it devoured a new flame.

28
00:01:44.244 --> 00:01:48.305
"That thing is getting enormous," Darb said nervously.

29
00:01:48.325 --> 00:01:50.346
"Yeah," said Zann.

30
00:01:50.666 --> 00:01:52.446
"It's also getting farther away.

31
00:01:52.887 --> 00:01:53.447
Follow me!"

32
00:01:54.227 --> 00:01:57.848
Zann bolted for the closest door and wound up in a deserted sitting room.

33
00:01:58.676 --> 00:02:02.059
A second later Perda, Gliss, and Darb were right beside him.

34
00:02:02.940 --> 00:02:04.040
Zann looked back at Zing.

35
00:02:04.401 --> 00:02:08.384
His pet dragon was still flying above the blob, shooting flames at the creature.

36
00:02:09.165 --> 00:02:13.868
Fala, Shem, Vig, and the others were running through a door at the other end of the entrance

37
00:02:13.908 --> 00:02:17.531
hall. "It looks like everyone's safe," Zann reported.

38
00:02:17.551 --> 00:02:20.133
"But that blob is bigger than ever!"

39
00:02:20.153 --> 00:02:22.835
"Let's get going," Darb said.

40
00:02:22.855 --> 00:02:26.018
"We don't know how fast it can move if it decides to chase us!"

41
00:02:26.999 --> 00:02:30.905
Zann whistled for Zing, who stopped breathing fire and flew to him right away.

42
00:02:32.005 --> 00:02:36.567
Then they all ran down a hallway until they were sure they'd left the blob far behind.

43
00:02:36.587 --> 00:02:39.408
"Where are we?"

44
00:02:39.709 --> 00:02:42.089
Darb wondered, after they'd stopped to catch their breath.

45
00:02:42.109 --> 00:02:45.391
"I've seen that painting of the king and queen before."

46
00:02:45.731 --> 00:02:46.411
Gliss pointed.

47
00:02:46.431 --> 00:02:50.213
"I think we're near the suite where Rixa and the others locked us in."

48
00:02:50.233 --> 00:02:53.374
"We should look for the dungeon," said Zann.

49
00:02:53.394 --> 00:02:58.056
"If that blob thing tells Morb we're here—" "How can it do that?"

50
00:02:58.412 --> 00:02:59.793
Perda interrupted with a laugh.

51
00:02:59.813 --> 00:03:02.635
"It doesn't have a mouth!"

52
00:03:03.436 --> 00:03:05.257
Meanwhile Gliss was walking ahead.

53
00:03:05.277 --> 00:03:09.520
"Here's the suite," she called, pushing open a door and peering in.

54
00:03:09.540 --> 00:03:13.002
"Oh! Is that the magic-sucking machine?"

55
00:03:13.843 --> 00:03:16.545
Zann, Perda, and Darb all looked into the room.

56
00:03:17.285 --> 00:03:22.429
In the center was a large contraption made of bones, books, stones, and other items.

57
00:03:23.750 --> 00:03:25.031
"No," said Zann.

58
00:03:25.051 --> 00:03:26.412
"This is something else."

59
00:03:27.276 --> 00:03:30.078
He looked at the grinning white skull perched on top.

60
00:03:30.859 --> 00:03:33.861
"Look! There's a map of Magica above that skull."

61
00:03:34.681 --> 00:03:36.502
"What are those red dots on the map?"

62
00:03:36.823 --> 00:03:37.423
Darb wondered.

63
00:03:37.443 --> 00:03:39.925
"I don't know," said Perda.

64
00:03:39.945 --> 00:03:42.807
"It looks like they're all clustered around the palace."

65
00:03:43.687 --> 00:03:44.548
Gliss gasped.

66
00:03:44.568 --> 00:03:48.711
"Morb's prisoners are in the palace—the red dots must be Reds!"

67
00:03:48.731 --> 00:03:56.932
"This machine is probably what Morb has been using to track us—and all the other Reds," said Zann.

68
00:03:56.952 --> 00:03:59.753
"I bet if we destroy it, we can use magic again!"

69
00:04:00.574 --> 00:04:05.456
Zann rushed into the room, grabbed a metal candlestick, and began hitting the machine with it.

70
00:04:06.136 --> 00:04:09.137
His friends joined in, using whatever objects they could find.

71
00:04:09.157 --> 00:04:10.858
"Look out!"

72
00:04:11.198 --> 00:04:12.219
Darb shouted suddenly.

73
00:04:13.119 --> 00:04:17.141
Spinning around, Zann saw a flock of tiny dragons zipping into the room.

74
00:04:17.941 --> 00:04:19.862
They swarmed the kids, stinging them.

75
00:04:19.882 --> 00:04:21.283
"Ignore them!"

76
00:04:21.683 --> 00:04:22.223
Zann called.

77
00:04:22.603 --> 00:04:24.744
"We have to—ouch!"

78
00:04:24.764 --> 00:04:26.605
One of the dragons had stung his hand.

79
00:04:27.326 --> 00:04:29.828
Zann dropped the candlestick, and it rolled under the machine.

80
00:04:30.928 --> 00:04:33.690
Zann looked around for another weapon, but he didn't see anything.

81
00:04:34.511 --> 00:04:37.193
He was about to kick the machine when he had a better idea.

82
00:04:37.953 --> 00:04:41.796
Standing on tiptoe, he reached up and grabbed the skull off the top.

83
00:04:42.477 --> 00:04:48.120
The map instantly blinked out of existence, and a strong shock of energy sizzled through Zann's entire body.

84
00:04:48.901 --> 00:04:52.764
Sparks swirled all around him, and his eyes began to feel strange.

85
00:04:53.844 --> 00:04:58.607
As he gripped the skull, energy jumped off his hands, and power surged through him.

86
00:04:58.627 --> 00:05:01.009
"Zann!" Perda shouted.

87
00:05:01.029 --> 00:05:02.690
"Your eyes are glowing!"

88
00:05:03.531 --> 00:05:06.713
Zann didn't answer—he had never felt so powerful.

89
00:05:07.434 --> 00:05:10.996
He took one hand off the skull and pointed it at the machine.

90
00:05:11.857 --> 00:05:16.580
Instantly a Blast spell shot from his hand, and the machine exploded.

91
00:05:17.361 --> 00:05:21.784
Perda, Darb, and Gliss shielded their faces as pieces flew everywhere.

92
00:05:22.796 --> 00:05:26.758
Then Zann heard Gliss scream as another tiny dragon stung her.

93
00:05:27.558 --> 00:05:29.219
Zann pointed at the nearest dragon.

94
00:05:29.959 --> 00:05:33.401
Another Blast spell shot out, even more powerful than the last.

95
00:05:34.181 --> 00:05:38.043
Gliss screamed again, jumping away just in time to avoid the blast.

96
00:05:38.883 --> 00:05:43.665
The spell vaporized several of the dragons—along with all the furniture that had been behind them.

97
00:05:43.685 --> 00:05:45.966
"Zann!" Perda cried.

98
00:05:45.986 --> 00:05:47.707
"What's happening to you?"

99
00:05:47.727 --> 00:05:49.447
"What do you mean?"

100
00:05:50.008 --> 00:05:50.568
asked Zann.

101
00:05:51.552 --> 00:05:54.955
He could feel magical energy shooting all around him like fireworks.

102
00:05:54.975 --> 00:05:57.576
"I've never felt better!"

103
00:05:58.397 --> 00:06:00.638
A new rush of energy coursed through his body.

104
00:06:01.439 --> 00:06:05.942
Zann sent out more Blast spells, obliterating every tiny dragon he saw.

105
00:06:06.822 --> 00:06:10.345
Soon the entire room had been reduced to a pile of rubble.

106
00:06:11.165 --> 00:06:14.528
Sunlight poured in through the holes Zann had made in the exterior wall.

107
00:06:15.228 --> 00:06:17.750
Perda and Gliss stared in horror.

108
00:06:17.770 --> 00:06:19.651
"It's that skull!"

109
00:06:19.951 --> 00:06:20.652
Darb exclaimed.

110
00:06:21.397 --> 00:06:23.827
"Zann, you have to drop it!"
